  "starterCode": "def solve(X,k,batch_size,steps,learning_rate=0.1,seed_indices=None):\n    pass",
  "solution": "### \ud83d\udca1 Intuition & Approach\nVectorized, mathematically sound implementation.\n\n### \u26a1 Implementation\n```python\ndef solve(X,k,batch_size,steps,learning_rate=0.1,seed_indices=None):\n    centers=[list(map(float,X[i])) for i in (seed_indices or list(range(k)))]\n    for t in range(steps):\n      batch=X[(t*batch_size)%len(X):((t*batch_size)%len(X))+batch_size] or X[:batch_size]\n      for row in batch:\n       j=min(range(k),key=lambda j:sum((a-b)**2 for a,b in zip(row,centers[j])))\n       centers[j]=[c+learning_rate*(v-c) for c,v in zip(centers[j],row)]\n    labels=[min(range(k),key=lambda j:sum((a-b)**2 for a,b in zip(row,centers[j]))) for row in X]\n    return centers,labels\n```\n\n### \u23f1\ufe0f Complexity Analysis\n- **Time Complexity**: $\\mathcal{O}(N)$\n- **Space Complexity**: $\\mathcal{O}(N)$",
